  "question": {
    "text": "The solution of the differential equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></msup><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math> is (where,&nbsp;<math><mi>c</mi></math> is an arbitrary constant)"
  },
